# Exercise 11: Set Intersection Check
# Write a code to check if two sets have any elements in common. If yes, display the common elements
# Given:
# set1 = {10, 20, 30, 40, 50}
# set2 = {60, 70, 80, 90, 10}
# Expected output:
# Two sets have items in common
# {10}
set1 = {10, 20, 30, 40, 50}
set2 = {60, 70, 80, 90, 10}
